/* 原版 NPC 日常关系线扩展 / 罗宾·伊甸·雷恩·布莱尔·艾弗里·黑狼 / 6 人 × 3 段 + 1 个入口 hub = 19 passages */
/* 只做日常、关系、小礼物与跑腿，不写大主线，不含露骨内容，失败不扣存款 */
:: MP Daily Extra Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "High Street")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "High Street">><</if>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
高街旧书摊侧面的小木架第二层挂着六枚不同质地的信物签：一枚画着笑脸的纸杯垫、一片带松脂香的干冷杉叶、一枚磨平字迹的铜筹码、一条暗红丝绒细带、一张印着烫金花体的便笺，以及一截绑着灰狼毛的皮绳。每样东西都对应着一个去过或托人捎过话的去处，按地点、时辰与往来交情随时可以过去看看。
街角的风吹动皮绳与丝绒带，你把六枚信物签理顺，挑定了今天想走一趟的方向。
<br><br>
<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<socialiseicon>><<link [[去找罗宾 (0:08)|MP Daily Robin 1]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">去找罗宾 (0:08)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Eden")>><<tendingicon>><<link [[去找伊甸 (0:14)|MP Daily Eden 1]]>><<pass 14>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">去找伊甸 (0:14)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Wren")>><<sneakicon>><<link [[去找雷恩 (0:08)|MP Daily Wren 1]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">去找雷恩 (0:08)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Briar")>><<link [[去找布莱尔 (0:08)|MP Daily Briar 1]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">去找布莱尔 (0:08)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Avery")>><<link [[去找艾弗里 (0:08)|MP Daily Avery 1]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">去找艾弗里 (0:08)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Black Wolf")>><<link [[去找黑狼 (0:15)|MP Daily BlackWolf 1]]>><<pass 15>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">去找黑狼 (0:15)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回高街 (0:02)|MP Daily Life Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>


/* ==================== 1. 罗宾 ==================== */

:: MP Daily Robin 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
孤儿院走廊尽头的木桌旁，<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>正把铁皮零钱盒里的硬币一枚枚倒在绒布上，鼻尖上沾了一点可可粉。周末摆摊剩下的纸杯受了潮，最底下几只粘在了一起，他一边数着一便士和两便士的铜板，一边小声叹气——昨天收摊时太匆忙，账本上的杯数比手头的零钱少了整整两先令。
听见你的脚步声，<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>立刻抬起头露出温和的笑意，把半块还温着的黄油饼干推到你手边：「你来得正好，我正算不明白这几摞纸杯呢。」
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[核对零钱纸杯 (0:08)|MP Daily Robin 2]]>>
	<<set $mpDailyRobin to Math.max(($mpDailyRobin or 0), 1)>><<pass 8>>
	<<if ($maths or 0) gte 250>>
		<<stress -2>>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_extra_robin_1")>><<money 150>><</if>>
		<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>>
	<</if>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[烘开受潮纸杯 (0:08)|MP Daily Robin 2]]>>
	<<set $mpDailyRobin to Math.max(($mpDailyRobin or 0), 1)>><<pass 8>>
	<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>>
		<<stress -2>>
		<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>>
	<</if>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[陪他吃饼干 (0:08)|MP Daily Robin 2]]>>
	<<set $mpDailyRobin to Math.max(($mpDailyRobin or 0), 1)>><<pass 8>><<stress -2>>
	<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><</if>>
<</link>>

:: MP Daily Robin 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
到了高街杂货店门外，<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>把折叠手推车停在台阶旁，手里拿着一张写满肉桂棒、方糖与淡奶的采购单。杂货店门口正卸着大袋面粉，过道窄得只容一人侧身通过，几个顽皮的街童围在手推车边好奇地拨弄车轮上的小铜铃。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>有些局促地护住车斗里的保温壶，既怕撞着店里的搬运工，又怕手推车滑下石阶。
<br><br>
<<fisticon>><<link [[扛出淡奶方糖 (0:08)|MP Daily Robin 3]]>>
	<<set $mpDailyRobin to Math.max(($mpDailyRobin or 0), 2)>><<pass 8>>
	<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250 or ($physique or 0) gte 7000>>
		<<stress -2>>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_extra_robin_2")>><<money 200>><</if>>
		<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>>
	<</if>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[哄走街童 (0:08)|MP Daily Robin 3]]>>
	<<set $mpDailyRobin to Math.max(($mpDailyRobin or 0), 2)>><<pass 8>>
	<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 250>>
		<<stress -2>>
		<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<stress 3>>
	<</if>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[并肩推车 (0:08)|MP Daily Robin 3]]>>
	<<set $mpDailyRobin to Math.max(($mpDailyRobin or 0), 2)>><<pass 8>><<stress -2>>
	<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><</if>>
<</link>>

:: MP Daily Robin 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "bedroom">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
回到孤儿院房间时，窗外已经染上了浅紫色的暮霭。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>在小炉上煮开第一壶加了新肉桂棒的热可可，浓郁的甜香很快填满了狭小的房间。他小心翼翼地盛出最上面飘着奶沫的一杯递给你，又从清洗干净的帆布袋夹层里摸出了昨天漏算的那枚两先令银币。
「原来卡在袋角缝线里了！」<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>如释重负地弯起眼睛，把银币旁边多出的几枚零钱硬塞进你掌心，说是今天请你的跑腿茶钱。
<br><br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[调糖霜收账册 (0:08)|MP Daily Extra Hub]]>>
	<<set $mpDailyRobin to 3>><<pass 8>>
	<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($english or 0) gte 250>>
		<<stress -3>>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_extra_robin_3")>><<money 200>><</if>>
		<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<stress 2>><<tiredness 1>>
	<</if>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[喝可可聊天 (0:08)|MP Daily Extra Hub]]>>
	<<set $mpDailyRobin to 3>><<pass 8>><<stress -3>>
	<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><</if>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回孤儿院 (0:02)|Orphanage]]>><<set $mpDailyRobin to 3>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

