:: MP Daily Eden 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
森林木屋的屋檐下堆着半人高的冷杉圆木，空气里飘着松脂与熏肉的浓郁气味。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Eden")>>伊甸<<else>>林间猎人<</if>>单手拎着沉重的宽刃劈柴斧，正将一段湿木桩架上树墩；旁边的烟熏木架下火苗有些发暗，几挂风干的鹿肉条需要添入新的干果木枝。
瞥见你走近木屋，<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Eden")>>伊甸<<else>>林间猎人<</if>>停下斧头，用下巴指了指脚边的竹篓：「既然来了就别闲着，要么把碎木抱进棚里，要么看着熏架别让火灭了。」
<br><br>
<<runicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Eden")>><<link [[抱柴随他进林 (0:07)|MP Daily Eden 2]]>>
	<<set $mpDailyEden to Math.max(($mpDailyEden or 0), 1)>><<pass 7>>
	<<if ($physique or 0) gte 7800>>
		<<stress -2>>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_extra_eden_1")>><<money 200>><</if>>
		<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Eden")>><<npcincr Eden trust 1>><</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<pain 2>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>>
	<</if>>
<</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">抱柴随他进林 (0:07)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[添果木稳火 (0:06)|MP Daily Eden 2]]>>
	<<set $mpDailyEden to Math.max(($mpDailyEden or 0), 1)>><<pass 6>>
	<<if ($tending or 0) gte 260>>
		<<stress -2>>
		<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Eden")>><<npcincr Eden love 1>><</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>>
	<</if>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[把柴码齐 (0:05)|MP Daily Eden 2]]>>
	<<set $mpDailyEden to Math.max(($mpDailyEden or 0), 1)>><<pass 5>><<stress -1>><<tiredness 1>>
	<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Eden")>><<npcincr Eden love 1>><</if>>
<</link>>

:: MP Daily Eden 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
密林小径上覆着厚厚的落叶，<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Eden")>>伊甸<<else>>林间猎人<</if>>背着猎步枪走在前面，带你巡查溪流北岸的几处防兽绳套。在一处桦木林拐角，原本用来标记安全浅滩的刻痕界石被山洪冲歪进了泥坑，而灌木丛下的钢丝绳套也被野猪拱乱了机关簧片。
林间雾气渐起，<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Eden")>>伊甸<<else>>林间猎人<</if>>蹲下身按住草丛，示意你跟紧他的脚步。
