:: MP Daily Eden 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
暮色笼罩森林时，你们回到了温暖干燥的木屋。壁炉里的松木烧得通红，铁锅里的蘑菇鹿肉汤咕嘟咕嘟冒着热气。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Eden")>>伊甸<<else>>林间猎人<</if>>坐在木桌旁用融化的蜂蜡擦拭猎弓弓弦，顺手盛了满满一粗陶碗热汤推到你面前，又把一张裁好的软鹿皮和几枚卖毛皮剩下的硬币放在桌角。
「靴子湿了就搁炉边烤烤，」<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Eden")>>伊甸<<else>>林间猎人<</if>>低头擦着弓身，声音比平时柔和了几分，「那块鹿皮拿去垫鞋底，林子里路滑。」
<br><br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[蜂蜡擦皮靴 (0:12)|MP Daily Extra Hub]]>>
	<<set $mpDailyEden to 3>><<pass 12>>
	<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($willpower or 0) gte 260>>
		<<stress -3>>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_extra_eden_3")>><<money 250>><</if>>
		<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Eden")>><<npcincr Eden love 1>><<npcincr Eden trust 1>><</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<stress 2>><<tiredness 1>>
	<</if>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[喝蘑菇肉汤 (0:12)|MP Daily Extra Hub]]>>
	<<set $mpDailyEden to 3>><<pass 12>><<stress -3>><<tiredness -1>>
	<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Eden")>><<npcincr Eden love 1>><</if>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回森林石径 (0:03)|Forest]]>><<set $mpDailyEden to 3>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

