:: MP Daily Wren 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
旧港三号栈桥背风的缆桩旁，<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Wren")>>雷恩<<else>>走私客<</if>>正半倚着木箱拆洗一只受潮的黄铜防风打火机，脚边的帆布袋里装着一沓刚从货船上卸下来的木制货牌。海雾把打火机的火石轮浸得直打滑，他试着擦了两下没打着火，抬头看见你走近，嘴角勾起一抹懒散的笑。
「来得巧，帮我搭把手，」<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Wren")>>雷恩<<else>>走私客<</if>>把那摞沾着海盐的木货牌往你手边一推，「有些货牌上的炭笔编号被浪打花了，得赶在货主来提货前认清楚。」
<br><br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[检修打火机 (0:05)|MP Daily Wren 2]]>>
	<<set $mpDailyWren to Math.max(($mpDailyWren or 0), 1)>><<pass 5>>
	<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260>>
		<<stress -2>>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_extra_wren_1")>><<money 200>><</if>>
		<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Wren")>><<npcincr Wren love 1>><</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<stress 3>>
	<</if>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[辨认货牌刻痕 (0:06)|MP Daily Wren 2]]>>
