:: MP Daily BlackWolf 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
野猪惊慌逃出领地边界后，<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Black Wolf")>>黑狼<<else>>领头巨狼<</if>>带着你回到一处避风的树根岩穴旁歇息。它用鼻子从干苔藓下拱出一只旅人遗落的旧皮囊与一截磨得光滑的鹿角，大度地推到你膝盖前，随后挨着你的身侧卧倒下来，温热的呼吸喷在你的手背上。
林间的风声在树冠上沙沙作响，<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Black Wolf")>>黑狼<<else>>领头巨狼<</if>>闭上眼睛任由你梳理它耳后的毛发，喉间发出满足的低吟。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[梳顺狼毛 (0:03)|Forest]]>><<set $mpDailyBlackWolf to 3>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[靠狼背小憩 (0:12)|MP Daily Extra Hub]]>>
	<<set $mpDailyBlackWolf to 3>><<pass 12>>
	<<if ($tending or 0) gte 260 or ($willpower or 0) gte 260>>
		<<stress -4>>
		<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_extra_blackwolf_3")>><<money 250>><</if>>
		<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Black Wolf")>><<npcincr "Black Wolf" love 1>><</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<stress -1>><<tiredness 1>>
	<</if>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回外林 (0:12)|MP Daily Extra Hub]]>>
	<<set $mpDailyBlackWolf to 3>><<pass 12>><<stress -4>><<tiredness -2>>
	<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Black Wolf")>><<npcincr "Black Wolf" love 1>><</if>>
<</link>>

